   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">I&#39;m trying to creative an interactive plot using ggvis for dynamic variables.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">For example,</p><pre style=\"padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mtcars </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> ggvis</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input_select</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">names</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mtcars</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> map </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> <a href=\"http://as.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://as.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484650388000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Bk4JvaJ8v55rhyzXsKenV\">as.name</a></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input_select</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">names</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mtcars</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">map </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> <a href=\"http://as.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://as.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484650388000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Bk4JvaJ8v55rhyzXsKenV\">as.name</a></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n       </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> layer_points</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">()</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">While this works, a similar approach to histograms isn&#39;t working.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">Example:</p><pre style=\"padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mtcars </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> ggvis</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input_select</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">names</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mtcars</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> map </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> <a href=\"http://as.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://as.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484650388000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Bk4JvaJ8v55rhyzXsKenV\">as.name</a></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> \r\n       </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> layer_histograms</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">()</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">results in Error: Visual property x.update is not a variable.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">Same thing for density plot as well. Can someone suggest what I&#39;m doing wrong?</p></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
